Package: descs
Title: Generate data frames for APA style descriptive statistics tables.
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Lucy", "Waldren", role = c("aut"),
    person("Mitch", "Callan", role = c("cre")
Description: This package create a data.frame for an APA formatted descriptive statistics table, including M, SD, and half-stacked correlation table (r, p, 95%CI).
